      "message": "feat(spotify): add live Spotify library browsing and on-demand streaming\n\n- Add SPOTIFY to LibraryFilter enum and register it in Library chips row and Appearance default tab settings.\n- Implement SpotifyPlaybackResolver with LRU song cache to resolve Spotify tracks to YouTube Music streams on demand without local database duplication.\n- Create LibrarySpotifyViewModel and LibrarySpotifyScreen following Nothing OS 5.0 monochrome aesthetic, supporting connect prompts, user profile header, liked songs count, and live playlists grid.\n- Observe DataStore sp_dc changes reactively and add ON_RESUME lifecycle refresh so live library loads immediately when returning from Spotify login.\n- Implement SpotifyPlaylistDetailViewModel and SpotifyPlaylistDetailScreen for browsable tracklists with cover hero, Play All, Shuffle, and active playback indicators.\n- Wire audio playback with YouTubeQueue for immediate stream extraction and media session sync.\n- Register 'spotify_playlist/{playlistId}' destination in NavigationBuilder.",
