      "message": "fix(auto): address review on Home cache and thumbnail fallback\n\n- Tag the persisted Auto Home snapshot with the signed-in account and\n  reset the in-memory one when the account changes, so shelves never\n  leak across accounts.\n- Hold homeMutex only to check and install a refresh, not during the\n  network fetch, so browse calls get the stale snapshot immediately;\n  bound the first Home request with a timeout.\n- Apply the 14-day shelf age limit when restoring the snapshot.\n- Fall back to hqdefault only on a 404 and store the result under the\n  original URL's disk cache key, so the missing variant is not\n  re-requested.",
