      "message": "fix(auto): stop 3-char prefixes matching unrelated words in addon search\n\nTesting the matcher against the deployed Qobuz addon showed the PR claim\nthat 'Yes' no longer matches 'Yesterday' was false: 'yes' is exactly\nMIN_TOKEN_MATCH_LEN (3) characters and is a prefix of 'yesterday', so\ntokensMatch() still accepted it and a different song could be substituted.\n\ntokensMatch() now also bounds the suffix length: the longer token may\nexceed the shorter prefix by at most MAX_PREFIX_SUFFIX_LEN (4) characters.\nInflections still match (love/lover, run/running) while unrelated words\ndo not (yes/yesterday, fire/fireflies).",
