      "message": "fix(auto): tighten addon title matching and bound browse artwork\n\nReview follow-up on #664.\n\n- selectBestMatch: token pairs now require a prefix relation and a minimum\n  length, so 'Yes' no longer matches 'Yesterday'; every token of the shorter\n  side must be covered, which is what actually prevents substituting a\n  different song.\n- stripSourcePrefix: only the last path segment is inspected, so hosts such as\n  https://api.example.com or https://host/api are no longer truncated to 'https:/'.\n- Addon requests get explicit connect/read/call timeouts and stop looping on\n  connection-level failures, which apply to every base on the same host.\n- AutomotiveArtwork: cap a browse response to 60 items, 160 KiB of artwork and\n  4 concurrent loads, keeping the parcel under Media3's 256 KiB limit instead of\n  silently truncating long lists.\n- Suggested and Recent results now get artwork embedded like the other nodes.",
