      "message": "fix(stats): prevent NullPointerException crash when opening Stats (#646)\n\n- Make SongWithStats.thumbnailUrl, artistName, and songCountListened safely nullable with defaults to prevent Room/Kotlin constructor NPEs when querying tracks without artwork (such as local/offline or uploaded songs).\n- Replace unsafe force-unwrapping (!!) on song and album play counts with null-safe defaults in StatsScreen.\n- Safely guard weekly, monthly, and yearly date range sequences against null event timestamps.\n- Avoid index mismatches by matching songs by ID instead of direct parallel index access on click.\n- Add StatsQueryNullSafetyTest verifying null thumbnail and stat query stability.\n- Record fix in upcomingupdate.json.",
