      "message": "fix(auto): embed browse artwork and stop blank-bitmap fallbacks\n\nAndroid Auto renders browse items at very different sizes and cannot fetch\nHTTP artwork itself, so covers only appeared while the app was alive and warm.\nResolve artwork while serving onGetChildren/onGetItem and embed it as\nartworkData so every automotive surface uses the same image.\n\nCoilBitmapLoader also returned a blank 64x64 bitmap on failure, which callers\ncache and render as a broken cover; it now propagates the failure and decodes\nat a size that covers the largest automotive surface.",
